-- =====================================================================
-- Session 143 — Matt 13 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 13's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2), S132 (Matt 3), S133 (Matt 4),
-- S134 (Matt 5), S135 (Matt 6), S137 (Matt 7-8 paired), S138 (Matt 9),
-- S139 (Matt 10), S140 (Matt 11), and S142 (Matt 12) extras-tier
-- coverage. Single chapter migration — Matt 13 is the seven-parables-of-
-- the-kingdom discourse with the chapter''s load-bearing FRAMEWORK-MAJOR
-- moment landing in the King-himself''s-interpretation of the wheat-and-
-- tares parable at vv.36-43: the direct Adam-and-the-Tares Red Line #11
-- seed-war architecture in the King''s own voice (the field is the
-- world; the good seed are the children of the kingdom; the tares are
-- the children of the wicked one; the enemy is the devil; the harvest
-- is the end of the age; the reapers are the angels; the righteous
-- shine as the sun in the kingdom of their Father).
--
-- Matt 13 reading-target: the chapter walks the seven parables across
-- two settings (four from the boat to the multitudes — sower, wheat-
-- and-tares, mustard-seed, leaven; three in the house to the disciples
-- — hidden treasure, pearl-of-great-price, dragnet) with the Yeshayahu
-- (Isaiah) 6:9-10 hardening-citation at vv.13-15 locking the cause-
-- and-effect-of-hearing per Red Line #11 (the giving precedes the
-- hearing — the Greek *dedotai* at v.11), the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR wheat-
-- and-tares interpretation at vv.36-43 locking the seed-war architecture,
-- the dragnet at vv.47-50 recapitulating the post-harvest-sifting, the
-- Psalm 78:2 citation at vv.34-35 locking the mysteries-kept-secret-
-- from-the-foundation-of-the-world, the treasure-and-pearl at vv.44-46
-- read with the Father-Son-buyer-finds-the-treasure substance (per the
-- chapter''s-own-architecture from vv.36-43 — the Sower is the Son of
-- Adam, the field is the world, the treasure-in-the-field is the
-- elect-treasure scattered through the field; the Father / the Son
-- finds-and-rejoices-and-pays-the-full-price-to-obtain), and the
-- hometown-rejection at Natsareth (Nazareth) at vv.53-58 enacting the
-- cause-and-effect-of-hearing diagnostic at the territorial-level. The
-- extras-library carries multiple direct framework-bearing anchors,
-- the heaviest cluster surrounding the wheat-and-tares architecture:
-- 1 Enoch 6 / 10 / 15 / 54 / 90 on the watchers'' incursion and the
-- binding-and-burning of the watchers'' hosts at the day of judgment;
-- Jubilees 5 / 7 / 10 on the watchers'' fall and the giants and the
-- evil-spirits; Jubilees 11 on Mastema sending ravens to snatch the
-- seed (THE strongest direct verbal-anchor for Matt 13:4''s fowls-came-
-- and-devoured-them-up); 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 3 / 4 / 8 on the seed-of-
-- good-and-evil sown in the heart of Adam (the wisdom-stream parallel
-- to the wheat-and-tares architecture); 1 Enoch 39 / 48 / 51 / 104 +
-- 2 Esdras 7:97, 7:125 + Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 on the righteous-shall-
-- shine-as-the-sun (1 Enoch 104:2''s *now shall ye shine as the lights
-- of heaven* is the direct verbal-anchor); 1 Enoch 46 / 48 + Wisdom of
-- Solomon 6:22 + 2 Esdras 6:26 on the mysteries-hidden-from-the-
-- foundation revealed to the elect (for the Psalm 78:2 citation
-- substance); Sirach 6 / 20 + Wisdom of Solomon 7 on the kingdom-of-
-- supreme-worth treasure-and-pearl architecture; 2 Esdras 7 / 8 +
-- 1 Enoch 100 + Wisdom of Solomon 3 on the wheat-from-chaff and
-- righteous-from-wicked separation at the day of judgment for the
-- dragnet recapitulation; Wisdom of Solomon 2:24 (*through envy of the
-- devil came death into the world* — THE direct verbal-anchor for the
-- devil-as-source-of-death and the seed-war substance) + Jubilees 4 +
-- 1 Enoch 22 on the seed-war from Bereshit (Genesis) 3 forward through
-- Qayin (Cain) and Hevel (Abel); 1 Enoch 48 / 51 + 2 Esdras 5 + Wisdom
-- of Solomon 1 + Sirach 39 on the wisdom-hidden-from-the-wicked-
-- revealed-to-the-elect architecture (for the parables-method-and-
-- Isaiah-6 citation substance).
--
-- Ten Hebrew-library threads track the chapter''s framework moves at
-- the restoration-not-innovation register:
--   * Wisdom hidden from the wicked and revealed to the elect at
--     vv.11-17 — 1 Enoch 48:7 (the wisdom of the Lord of Spirits
--     revealed to the holy and elect); 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:9-10 (the
--     wisdom hides herself from the malicious-disposition); Wisdom of
--     Solomon 1:4 (wisdom will not enter into a malicious soul);
--     Sirach 39:6 (wisdom poured out upon the just by the great
--     Yahuah (Lord)).
--   * The birds-of-the-air snatching the seed as Mastema-and-the-
--     watchers'' work at vv.4, 19 — Jubilees 11:11 (Prince Mastema
--     sends ravens and birds to devour the seed sown in the land —
--     THE strongest direct verbal-anchor); 1 Enoch 19:1 (the spirits
--     of the watchers leading men astray to sacrifice to demons).
--   * The seed-of-good-and-evil sown in the heart of Adam at vv.24-30
--     — 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:30-31 (the evil-seed sown in the heart of
--     Adam from the beginning — the wisdom-stream parallel to the
--     wheat-and-tares architecture); 2 Esdras 3:21-22 (the evil-heart
--     which the first Adam bore); 2 Esdras 8:6 (give us seed unto our
--     heart, and culture to our understanding).
--   * The watchers'' corruption as tares-sown-in-the-wheat at vv.25, 38
--     — 1 Enoch 6:1-6 (the watchers descend to the daughters of men);
--     1 Enoch 10:9 (the bastards / sons-of-fornication / children-of-
--     the-watchers shall see the destruction of their beloved ones);
--     1 Enoch 15:8-9 (the spirits of the giants oppress and corrupt
--     the earth); Jubilees 5:1-2 (the watchers'' fall and the giants
--     begotten); Jubilees 7:21-22 (the giants and the unrighteousness
--     brought to the earth).
--   * Binding the watchers at the day of judgment with fire at vv.30,
--     41-42 — 1 Enoch 10:13-14 (the watchers bound in the valleys of
--     the earth till the day of judgment when they shall be led off to
--     the abyss of fire); 1 Enoch 54:6 (Mikha''el and Gavri''el and
--     Raphael and Phanuel cast the hosts of Azazel into the burning
--     furnace at the great day); 1 Enoch 90:25 (the seventy-shepherds
--     judged and cast into the abyss-of-fire).
--   * The righteous shall shine as the sun at v.43 — 1 Enoch 104:2
--     (*now shall ye shine as the lights of heaven* — THE direct
--     verbal-anchor); 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:97 (the seventh-order: the
--     face of the righteous shall shine as the sun); 2 Esdras 7:125
--     (the faces of those who have practised abstinence shall shine
--     above the stars); Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 (in the time of their
--     visitation they shall shine, and run to and fro like sparks).
--   * Mysteries hidden from the foundation revealed to the elect at
--     vv.34-35 — 1 Enoch 48:6-7 (the Son-of-Adam / Elect-One was
--     hidden from the foundation-of-the-world and revealed to the holy
--     and elect); 1 Enoch 46:1-3 (the secrets of righteousness revealed
--     to the chosen by the head-of-days); Wisdom of Solomon 6:22 (I
--     will declare it and will not hide the mysteries); 2 Esdras (4
--     Ezra) 6:26 (the secrets revealed in the latter days to the
--     remnant).
--   * The kingdom-of-supreme-worth as treasure and pearl at vv.44-46 —
--     Sirach 20:30 (wisdom-that-is-hid and treasure-that-is-hoarded);
--     Sirach 6:14-15 (a faithful friend is the medicine of life:
--     nothing doth countervail him); Wisdom of Solomon 7:8-9 (wisdom
--     preferred above sceptres and thrones; gold and silver as a little
--     sand); Wisdom of Solomon 7:14 (wisdom is a treasure unto men
--     that never faileth).
--   * Wheat-from-chaff and righteous-from-wicked at the day of
--     separation at vv.47-50 — 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:33 (the most-High
--     shall appear upon the seat of judgment); 2 Esdras 8:3 (many be
--     created, but few shall be saved — the wheat-and-chaff wisdom-
--     stream architecture); 1 Enoch 100:5 (over the righteous he will
--     appoint guardians of the holy angels to guard them as the apple
--     of an eye, while the sinners shall be afflicted); Wisdom of
--     Solomon 3:8 (the righteous shall judge the nations and have
--     dominion over the people).
--   * Seed-war from Bereshit (Genesis) 3 forward with the devil as the
--     source of death at vv.38-39 — Wisdom of Solomon 2:24 (*through
--     envy of the devil came death into the world: and they that do
--     hold of his side do find it* — THE direct verbal-anchor for the
--     devil-as-source-of-death and the seed-war substance); 1 Enoch
--     22:7 (the spirit of Hevel (Abel) cries out against Qayin (Cain)
--     — the seed-war''s first victim); Jubilees 4:2 (Qayin (Cain) slew
--     Hevel (Abel) — Jubilees'' direct restatement of the Bereshit 4
--     murder).
--
-- Editions used at S143: Apocrypha KJV 1611 (`apocrypha` — Sirach /
-- Ecclesiasticus, Wisdom of Solomon, 2 Esdras / 4 Ezra), 1 Enoch
-- (`enoch`), Jubilees (`jubilees`). The pseudepigrapha edition is not
-- used at S143 (Matt 13 readings do not surface framework-bearing
-- connections from Testaments of XII / 4 Maccabees / 2 Baruch / 2 Enoch
-- / Adam-Eve at the rigour the migration requires beyond what the
-- apocrypha / 1 Enoch / Jubilees threads already carry). Sonnini''s
-- Acts of Paul, Ascension of Isaiah, Apocalypse of Abraham, and Adam-
-- Eve Conflict do not surface framework-bearing Matt 13 connections at
-- S143. Historical-witness editions (Josephus, M.R. James''s apocryphal
-- NT, Lightfoot''s Apostolic Fathers) remain deferred from V1 cross-
-- refs per the historical-witness one-way rule. The lookup view retains
-- the full S139 edition set for forward compatibility.
--
-- Ten PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1.  `wisdom-hidden-from-the-wicked-revealed-to-the-elect-in-1-enoch-and-2-esdras-and-wisdom`            (sort 282)
--   2.  `birds-of-the-air-snatching-the-seed-mastema-and-the-watchers-in-jubilees-and-1-enoch`              (sort 283)
--   3.  `seed-of-good-and-evil-sown-in-the-heart-of-adam-in-2-esdras`                                       (sort 284)
--   4.  `watchers-corruption-as-tares-sown-in-the-wheat-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees`                            (sort 285)
--   5.  `binding-the-watchers-at-the-day-of-judgment-with-fire-in-1-enoch`                                  (sort 286)
--   6.  `righteous-shall-shine-as-the-sun-in-1-enoch-and-2-esdras-and-wisdom`                               (sort 287)
--   7.  `mysteries-hidden-from-the-foundation-revealed-to-the-elect-in-1-enoch-and-wisdom-and-2-esdras`     (sort 288)
--   8.  `kingdom-of-supreme-worth-treasure-and-pearl-in-sirach-and-wisdom-of-solomon`                       (sort 289)
--   9.  `wheat-from-chaff-and-righteous-from-wicked-at-the-day-of-separation-in-2-esdras-and-1-enoch-and-wisdom` (sort 290)
--   10. `seed-war-from-genesis-3-and-the-devil-as-source-of-death-in-wisdom-and-jubilees-and-1-enoch`       (sort 291)
--
-- 36 new cross_references rows at tier_required=''extras'' (Library tier,
-- $4.99) + 10 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=''complete_study''
-- (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors the two-layer
-- architecture of the chapter-end card: Layer 1 (per-verse cross-refs)
-- visible to Library readers who have access to the extras-library
-- editions the refs point to; Layer 2 (framework thread callouts with
-- summary_md + member_notes) gated at Companion, since the threads ARE
-- the framework''s reading of how canon and library answer each other —
-- the "hidden detail expand" that is the Companion-tier upgrade. Every
-- member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar''el,
-- Ya''aqov, Yechezk''el, Yo''el, Ya''ir, Sha''ul, Mikha''el, Gavri''el,
-- etc.) are escaped per SQL single-quoted-string-literal convention
-- (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 143 — Matt 13 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S142 view including
-- `sonnini-acts-29`; retained for forward compatibility even though
-- Matt 13 does not surface a Sonnini Acts 29 connection at S143.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s143_verse_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 36 extras-tier cross_references rows.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- Thread 1: wisdom-hidden-from-the-wicked-revealed-to-the-elect
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 11, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 7,
   '*And the wisdom of the Lord of Spirits hath revealed him to the holy and righteous; for he hath preserved the lot of the righteous, because they have hated and despised this world of unrighteousness, and have hated all its works and ways in the name of the Lord of Spirits: for in his name they are saved, and he is the avenger of their life.* 1 Enoch 48:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-revealed-to-the-holy-and-righteous architecture: the Lord of Spirits reveals the Elect-One AND the wisdom-of-the-Lord-of-Spirits to those-who-hate-the-world-of-unrighteousness. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:11''s *because it is given unto you to know the mysteries of the kingdom of heaven, but to them it is not given.* The Greek *dedotai* (passive-perfect-tense, *it has been given*) names a giving-that-precedes-the-hearing; the wisdom-stream had named the architecture at the elect-receiving register. The disciples-hear because they have-been-given-to-hear; the multitudes-do-not-hear because they have-not-been-given. The giving precedes; the response reveals. Election-precedes-hearing per Red Line #11.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 11, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 5, 9,
   '*And salt waters shall be found in the sweet, and all friends shall destroy one another; then shall wit hide itself, and understanding withdraw itself into his secret chamber, And shall be sought of many, and yet not be found: then shall unrighteousness and incontinency be multiplied upon earth.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:9-10 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-and-understanding-withdrawing-into-the-secret-chamber architecture: in the latter-days the understanding withdraws-itself and shall-be-sought-of-many-and-not-be-found. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:11-17''s cause-and-effect-of-hearing diagnostic: the understanding the multitudes seek-from-the-parables withdraws from the system-rejecting-disposition; the wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-withdrawal-from-the-disposition-that-rejects. The disciples-receive the mysteries-of-the-kingdom because the disposition-to-receive operates; the system-rejecting-disposition encounters the withdrawn-understanding.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 13, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 1, 4,
   '*For into a malicious soul wisdom shall not enter; nor dwell in the body that is subject unto sin.* Wisdom of Solomon 1:4 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the wisdom-shall-not-enter-into-a-malicious-soul architecture: wisdom does-not-enter the malicious-soul; the disposition determines the entry. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:13-15''s Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 6:9-10 citation: the people''s-heart has waxed-gross because they-have-closed-their-own-eyes; the wisdom does not enter the disposition-that-closes. The wisdom-stream knew the architecture-of-the-soul-that-refuses-wisdom; Matt 13:13-15 names the operative-form at the Pharisaic-system-rejecting-the-King register. The Father does not actively-prevent the hearing; the disposition closes itself; the wisdom encounters-the-closure.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 16, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 39, 6,
   '*When the great Lord will, he shall be filled with the spirit of understanding: he shall pour out wise sentences, and give thanks unto the Lord in his prayer.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 39:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the spirit-of-understanding-poured-out-on-the-elect-scribe architecture: when-the-great-Yahuah-wills, the scribe shall-be-filled-with-the-spirit-of-understanding. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:16-17''s *blessed are your eyes, for they see: and your ears, for they hear.* The disciples'' blessing-of-seeing-and-hearing operates in the same architecture the wisdom-stream had named — the spirit-of-understanding poured-out by Yahuah (the Lord) on the elect-disciples. The wisdom-stream knew the architecture; Matt 13:16-17 names the operative-blessing at the apostolic-circle.'),

  -- Thread 2: birds-of-the-air-snatching-the-seed-mastema-and-the-watchers
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 4, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 11, 11,
   '*And Prince Mastema sent ravens and birds to devour the seed which was sown in the land, in order to destroy the land, so as to rob the children of men of their labours. Before they could plough in the seed, the ravens picked it from the surface of the ground.* Jubilees 11:11 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for Matt 13:4''s *fowls came and devoured them up* substance: Prince Mastema (the leader-of-the-evil-spirits) sends ravens and birds to-devour-the-seed-sown-in-the-land. The framework reads the parallel as one architecture across two registers: the wisdom-stream knew the adversary-sending-birds-to-snatch-the-seed-substance; the King at Matt 13:4 walks the operative-parable-form in his own teaching. The fowls of Matt 13:4 are NOT neutral-wildlife; they are the wicked-one-of-Matt-13:19 in operative-form, the same Mastema-Satan-substance the wisdom-stream had named. The Avraham-driving-away-the-fowls at Bereshit (Genesis) 15:11 + the Jubilees 11:11 Mastema-sending-the-birds + the Matt 13:4-19 King''s-naming-the-wicked-one walk one architecture across the canon and the wisdom-stream.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 19, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 19, 1,
   '*And Uri''el said to me: "Here shall stand the angels who have connected themselves with women, and their spirits assuming many different forms are defiling mankind and shall lead them astray into sacrificing to demons as gods, (here shall they stand,) till the day of the great judgment in which they shall be judged till they are made an end of.* 1 Enoch 19:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the spirits-of-the-watchers leading-mankind-astray architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:19''s *when any one heareth the word of the kingdom, and understandeth it not, then cometh the wicked one, and catcheth away that which was sown in his heart.* The wicked-one Yahusha (Jesus) names is operationally the same actor the wisdom-stream had named — the spirits-of-the-watchers who lead-mankind-astray into sacrificing-to-demons-as-gods. The wicked-one snatches the seed by leading-the-hearer-astray; the wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the King names the operative-form at the parable-of-the-sower register. The disposition-to-be-led-astray (the not-understanding of v.19) is what the wicked-one exploits.'),

  -- Thread 3: seed-of-good-and-evil-sown-in-the-heart-of-adam
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 24, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 4, 30,
   '*For the grain of evil seed hath been sown in the heart of Adam from the beginning, and how much ungodliness hath it brought up unto this time? and how much shall it yet bring forth until the time of threshing shall come?* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 4:30 names THE direct wisdom-stream parallel to the wheat-and-tares architecture at the heart-of-Adam register: the grain-of-evil-seed has been-sown-in-the-heart-of-Adam-from-the-beginning, AND the ungodliness it has produced continues-to-grow-until-the-time-of-threshing. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:24-30''s *the kingdom of heaven is likened unto a man which sowed good seed in his field: But while men slept, his enemy came and sowed tares among the wheat.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-evil-seed-sown-from-the-beginning AND the time-of-threshing-when-the-sorting-occurs; the King at Matt 13:24-30 names the operative-parable-form. The framework reads the architecture in continuity: the watchers'' incursion at Bereshit (Genesis) 6:1-4 + the dragon''s corruption-of-the-line at Bereshit 3 + the seed-of-evil-sown-from-the-beginning at 4 Ezra 4:30 + the King''s tares-sown-by-the-enemy at Matt 13:24-30 = one architecture across the canon and the wisdom-stream.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 25, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 3, 21,
   '*For the first Adam bearing a wicked heart transgressed, and was overcome; and so be all they that are born of him. Thus infirmity was made permanent; and the law also in the heart of the people with the malignity of the root; so that the good departed away, and the evil abode still.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 3:21-22 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wicked-heart-inherited-from-Adam architecture: the first-Adam bore the wicked-heart; all-who-are-born-of-him inherit the operative-pattern. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:25''s *while men slept, his enemy came and sowed tares.* The wisdom-stream had named the inherited-wicked-heart as the architecture-the-tares-grow-in; the King''s parable names the operative-form of the enemy-sowing-while-the-watchful-guard-fails. The framework reads the architecture WITHOUT collapsing into the Augustinian-original-sin doctrine in its Christian-developed form: the framework preserves the actor''s-disposition (the watchful-guard-fails; *while men slept*) without erasing the actor''s-responsibility; the wisdom-stream knew the inherited-heart-architecture without the Christian-doctrinal-overlay.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 24, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 8, 6,
   '*O Yahuah (Lord) that bearest rule, of every spirit that liveth, give us seed unto our heart, and culture to our understanding, that there may come fruit of it; whereby every one shall live that is corrupt, who beareth the place of a man.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 8:6 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the prayer-for-seed-unto-the-heart architecture: Yahuah (Lord) is asked-for-seed-unto-the-heart and culture-to-the-understanding so-that-fruit-may-come. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:24''s *the kingdom of heaven is likened unto a man which sowed good seed in his field.* The wisdom-stream knew the architecture of seed-given-by-Yahuah (Lord) to the heart that fruit-may-come; the King at Matt 13:24 names the operative-parable-form of the Sower-of-the-good-seed. The framework reads the architecture in continuity: the prayer of 4 Ezra 8:6 (give-us-seed-unto-our-heart) is the disposition the good-ground-soil at Matt 13:23 carries; the Sower''s sowing IS the answer to the wisdom-stream''s prayer.'),

  -- Thread 4: watchers-corruption-as-tares-sown-in-the-wheat
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 25, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 6, 1,
   '*And it came to pass when the children of men had multiplied that in those days were born unto them beautiful and comely daughters. And the angels, the children of the heaven, saw and lusted after them, and said to one another: "Come, let us choose us wives from among the children of men and beget us children."* 1 Enoch 6:1-2 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the watchers'' incursion: the children-of-the-heaven saw-and-lusted-after the daughters-of-men and took-wives-from-among-them. The framework reads the verse as THE foundational-anchor for the tares-sown-by-the-enemy at Matt 13:25. The watchers'' incursion produced the corrupted-line-of-the-giants and the spirits-of-the-giants that operate within-the-field-of-the-world as the seed-of-the-wicked-one. The King at Matt 13:25 names the operative-parable-form of the architecture the wisdom-stream had named at the chronological-source register: the enemy-sowing-tares-while-men-slept is the wisdom-stream''s watchers-coming-while-men-slept-in-Yared (Jared)''s-days.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 38, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 10, 9,
   '*And to Gavri''el (Gabriel) said Yahuah (the Lord): "Proceed against the bastards and the reprobates, and against the children of fornication: and destroy [the children of fornication and] the children of the Watchers from amongst men: and cause them to go forth: send them one against the other that they may destroy each other in battle: for length of days shall they not have."* 1 Enoch 10:9 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the children-of-the-watchers as the bastards-and-reprobates-and-children-of-fornication architecture: a specific-people-with-specific-paternal-source distinguished from the line-of-Adam. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:38''s *the tares are the children of the wicked one.* The wisdom-stream had named the children-of-the-watchers as a paternal-source-distinguishable-people; the King at Matt 13:38 names the operative-architecture of the children-of-the-wicked-one as a paternal-source-distinguishable-people-within-the-field-of-the-world. The framework reads the architecture in continuity: the watchers'' incursion at Bereshit (Genesis) 6:1-4 produces a corrupted-line that operates-within-the-field-of-the-world as the seed-of-the-wicked-one alongside the seed-of-Adam.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 38, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 15, 8,
   '*And now, the giants, who are produced from the spirits and flesh, shall be called evil spirits upon the earth, and on the earth shall be their dwelling. Evil spirits have proceeded from their bodies; because they are born from men and from the holy Watchers is their beginning and primal origin; they shall be evil spirits on earth, and evil spirits shall they be called.* 1 Enoch 15:8-9 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the spirits-of-the-giants-as-evil-spirits-upon-the-earth architecture: the giants died-physically but the spirits-of-the-giants continue-on-the-earth as evil-spirits. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:38-39''s *the tares are the children of the wicked one ... the enemy that sowed them is the devil.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the spirits-of-the-corruption operating-on-the-earth after the original-watchers'' incursion; the King''s parable names the operative-form of the seed-distinction at the field-of-the-world register. The evil-spirits-of-the-giants are the operative-instruments of the wicked-one''s-sowing across the age.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 25, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 5, 1,
   '*And it came to pass when the children of men began to multiply on the face of the earth and daughters were born unto them, that the angels of Yahuah (the Lord) saw them on a certain year of this jubilee, that they were beautiful to look upon; and they took themselves wives of all whom they chose, and they bare unto them sons and they were giants.* Jubilees 5:1-2 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the watchers'' incursion: the angels-of-Yahuah (the Lord) took-wives of the daughters-of-men and begat-giants. The framework reads the verse as a wisdom-stream parallel to 1 Enoch 6:1-2 (same incursion, slightly different angle). The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:25''s tares-sown-by-the-enemy-while-men-slept: the wisdom-stream witnesses across both Jubilees AND 1 Enoch the watchers'' incursion as the foundational-architecture the wheat-and-tares parable operates within. Two wisdom-stream witnesses establish the substance the King''s parable names.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 38, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 7, 21,
   '*For owing to these three things came the flood upon the earth, namely, owing to the fornication wherein the Watchers against the law of their ordinances went a whoring after the daughters of men, and took themselves wives of all which they chose: and they made the beginning of uncleanness. And they begat sons the Naphidim, and they were all unlike, and they devoured one another: and the Giants slew the Naphil, and the Naphil slew the Eljo, and the Eljo mankind, and one man another.* Jubilees 7:21-22 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the watchers''-fornication-and-the-naphidim-naphil-eljo lineages as the architecture-of-the-pre-flood-corruption. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:38''s *the tares are the children of the wicked one.* The wisdom-stream had named the multiple-corrupted-lineages from the watchers'' incursion as the architecture-of-the-pre-flood-corruption; the framework reads the post-flood-continuation as the same architecture operating-within-the-field-of-the-world that the King''s wheat-and-tares parable names at the gospel-level.'),

  -- Thread 5: binding-the-watchers-at-the-day-of-judgment-with-fire
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 42, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 10, 13,
   '*And in those days they shall be led off to the abyss of fire: and to the torment and the prison in which they shall be confined for ever. And whosoever shall be condemned and destroyed will from thenceforth be bound together with them to the end of all generations.* 1 Enoch 10:13-14 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the watchers'' eschatological-judgment: led-off-to-the-abyss-of-fire at the day-of-judgment with-the-torment-and-prison-everlasting. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:42''s *and shall cast them into a furnace of fire: there shall be wailing and gnashing of teeth.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-abyss-of-fire-at-the-day-of-judgment; the King at Matt 13:42 names the operative-form of the architecture the wisdom-stream had named. The framework reads the architecture in continuity with the S142 thread (binding-the-watchers-typological-anchor-for-binding-the-strong-man) — the inaugurated-binding at the King''s present-age-ministry leads to the eschatological-final-binding-and-burning at the harvest the present chapter names.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 42, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 54, 6,
   '*And Mikha''el (Michael), and Gavri''el (Gabriel), and Raphael, and Phanuel shall take hold of them on that great day, and cast them on that day into the burning furnace, that Yahuah (the Lord) of Spirits may take vengeance on them for their unrighteousness in becoming subject to Satan and leading astray those who dwell on the earth.* 1 Enoch 54:6 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for Matt 13:42''s *furnace of fire* substance: the four-archangels (Mikha''el and Gavri''el and Raphael and Phanuel) cast-the-hosts-of-Azazel into-the-burning-furnace on-the-great-day. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:42 and the *reapers are the angels* identification of v.39: the wisdom-stream knew the angelic-architecture of the eschatological-binding-and-burning; the King names the operative-form at the parable-of-the-wheat-and-tares-interpretation register. The angels-as-reapers + the burning-furnace + the day-of-judgment + the cause-of-judgment (subject-to-Satan-and-leading-astray-the-earth-dwellers) all align across the wisdom-stream and the gospel.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 41, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 90, 25,
   '*And the judgement was held first over the stars, and they were judged and found guilty, and went to the place of condemnation, and they were cast into an abyss, full of fire and flaming, and full of pillars of fire.* 1 Enoch 90:25 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the seventy-shepherds-judged-and-cast-into-the-abyss-of-fire architecture (in the animal-apocalypse register): the angelic-shepherds who-failed-in-their-stewardship judged-and-cast-into-the-abyss-of-fire-and-flaming-pillars-of-fire. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:41''s *the Son of Adam shall send forth his angels, and they shall gather out of his kingdom all things that offend, and them which do iniquity.* The wisdom-stream knew the architecture of the angelic-stewards-judged at the day-of-judgment AND the abyss-of-fire as the place-of-condemnation; the King names the operative-form of the gathering-out-of-the-kingdom-all-things-that-offend at the wheat-and-tares-interpretation register. The wisdom-stream''s eschatological-judgment-architecture corroborates the King''s wheat-and-tares-interpretation directly.'),

  -- Thread 6: righteous-shall-shine-as-the-sun
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 43, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 104, 2,
   '*Be hopeful; for aforetime ye were put to shame through ill and affliction; but now ye shall shine as the lights of heaven, ye shall shine and ye shall be seen, and the portals of heaven shall be opened to you.* 1 Enoch 104:2 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for Matt 13:43''s *then shall the righteous shine forth as the sun in the kingdom of their Father* substance: the righteous shall-shine-as-the-lights-of-heaven at the eschatological-vindication. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:43: the wisdom-stream knew the architecture of the righteous-shining-as-the-lights-of-heaven at the day-of-vindication; the King names the operative-form at the wheat-and-tares-interpretation register. The shall-be-seen-and-the-portals-of-heaven-shall-be-opened substance carries the kingdom-of-the-Father vindication-architecture the King names at Matt 13:43. Two wisdom-stream witnesses (1 Enoch 104:2 here and Daniel 12:3 at the Tanakh-register) establish the substance the King''s parable interpretation names at the gospel-register.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 43, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 97,
   '*The sixth order, when it is shewed them how their face shall shine as the sun, and how they shall be made like unto the light of the stars, being henceforth incorruptible.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:97 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the face-of-the-righteous-shall-shine-as-the-sun architecture at the resurrection-glory register: the righteous-orders-of-the-resurrection see-their-face-shall-shine-as-the-sun and be-made-like-unto-the-light-of-the-stars-incorruptible. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:43''s *then shall the righteous shine forth as the sun.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-shining-as-the-sun at the resurrection-orders register; the King names the operative-form at the wheat-and-tares-interpretation-of-the-righteous-in-the-kingdom-of-the-Father register. The wisdom-stream and the gospel name one architecture across two registers.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 43, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 125,
   '*That the faces of them which have used abstinence shall shine above the stars, but our faces shall be blacker than darkness?* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:125 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the faces-of-the-righteous-shall-shine-above-the-stars architecture: the abstinent-righteous shall-shine-above-the-stars at the day-of-judgment. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:43: the wisdom-stream witness establishes the architecture across multiple registers (the sixth-order at 7:97; the abstinent-righteous at 7:125). The post-harvest-sifting of the wheat (the chapter''s architecture per Red Line #11) lands at the shine-as-the-sun substance the wisdom-stream had named at multiple registers; the gathered-wheat that has-borne-fruit shines-as-the-sun in the kingdom of their Father.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 43, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 7,
   '*And in the time of their visitation they shall shine, and run to and fro like sparks among the stubble.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the righteous-shall-shine-at-the-time-of-their-visitation architecture: the souls-of-the-righteous shall-shine and run-like-sparks-among-the-stubble at the time-of-their-visitation. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:43: the visitation-of-the-righteous at the wisdom-stream register is the same eschatological-vindication the King names at the wheat-and-tares-interpretation register. The sparks-among-the-stubble carries the harvest-and-burning imagery directly — the same harvest the King''s parable names, with the righteous-shining-as-sparks-among-the-burning-tares.'),

  -- Thread 7: mysteries-hidden-from-the-foundation-revealed-to-the-elect
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 35, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 48, 6,
   '*And for this reason hath he been chosen and hidden before him, before the creation of the world and for evermore.* 1 Enoch 48:6 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for Matt 13:35''s *I will utter things which have been kept secret from the foundation of the world* substance: the Elect-One was-chosen-and-hidden-before-the-creation-of-the-world-and-for-evermore. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:34-35: the wisdom-stream knew the architecture of the Elect-One hidden-from-the-foundation-of-the-world and revealed-at-the-appointed-time; the King at Matt 13:35 fulfills the Psalm 78:2 substance by uttering things-which-have-been-kept-secret-from-the-foundation-of-the-world. The wisdom-stream and the King''s-own-self-disclosure name one architecture: the substance hidden from the foundation is the substance the parables-method now reveals to the disciples.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 34, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 46, 3,
   '*And he answered and said unto me: "This is the Son of Adam who hath righteousness, with whom dwelleth righteousness, and who reveals all the treasures of that which is hidden, because the Lord of Spirits hath chosen him, and whose lot hath the pre-eminence before the Lord of Spirits in uprightness for ever."* 1 Enoch 46:3 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Son-of-Adam-reveals-the-treasures-of-that-which-is-hidden architecture: the Son-of-Adam is the One-who-reveals-the-hidden-treasures-of-righteousness; the Lord-of-Spirits chose him for this office. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:34-35''s parables-method: the King teaches in parables AS the Son-of-Adam revealing-the-treasures-of-that-which-is-hidden the wisdom-stream had named. The Sower-of-the-good-seed of v.37 IS the same Son-of-Adam the wisdom-stream had named as the Revealer-of-the-hidden-treasures. The parables-method is the operative-form of the office the wisdom-stream had named.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 35, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 6, 22,
   '*As for wisdom, what she is, and how she came up, I will tell you, and will not hide mysteries from you; but will seek her out from the beginning of her nativity, and bring the knowledge of her into light, and will not pass over the truth.* Wisdom of Solomon 6:22 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the I-will-not-hide-mysteries-from-you architecture: the wisdom-stream''s teacher commits to bring-the-knowledge-into-light and not-pass-over-the-truth. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:35''s *I will utter things which have been kept secret from the foundation of the world*: the wisdom-stream''s commitment-to-reveal-the-mysteries operates in the same register the King''s parables-method enacts. The mysteries-kept-secret-from-the-foundation revealed-now to the disciples is the operative-form of the architecture the wisdom-stream had named at its teacher-register.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 35, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 6, 26,
   '*And the heart of the inhabitants shall be changed, and turned into another meaning. For evil shall be put out, and deceit shall be quenched. As for the faith, it shall flourish; corruption shall be overcome, and the truth, which hath been so long without fruit, shall be declared.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 6:26-28 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the truth-which-hath-been-so-long-without-fruit-shall-be-declared architecture: the latter-days will see the long-hidden-truth declared-at-last. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:35: the wisdom-stream knew the architecture-of-the-truth-revealed-after-long-hiddenness; the King''s parables-method names the operative-form of the architecture the wisdom-stream had named. The truth-without-fruit-for-a-long-time = the substance-kept-secret-from-the-foundation-of-the-world; the declared-at-last = the King''s-revealing-through-the-parables.'),

  -- Thread 8: kingdom-of-supreme-worth-treasure-and-pearl
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 44, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 20, 30,
   '*Wisdom that is hid, and treasure that is hoarded up, what profit is in them both?* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 20:30 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-that-is-hid-and-treasure-that-is-hoarded-up architecture: the hidden-treasure has no profit-to-those-who-do-not-find-and-obtain-it. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:44''s *the kingdom of heaven is like unto treasure hid in a field*: the wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the hidden-treasure-and-the-finding-and-obtaining; the King names the operative-form at the kingdom-of-heaven register. The framework''s reading per the Father-Son-buyer-finds-the-treasure substance (per Red Line #11): the Father / the Son is the One-who-finds-the-hidden-treasure (the elect scattered through the field-of-the-world) and pays-the-full-price-to-obtain. The Tanakh-substance and the wisdom-stream-substance and the King''s-parable-substance all carry the architecture.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 45, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 6, 14,
   '*A faithful friend is a strong defence: and he that hath found such an one hath found a treasure. Nothing doth countervail a faithful friend, and his excellency is invaluable.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 6:14-15 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the finding-a-faithful-friend-is-finding-a-treasure-nothing-countervails architecture: the supreme-worth substance of the faithful-friend is incomparable; nothing equals it. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:45-46''s *the kingdom of heaven is like unto a merchant man, seeking goodly pearls: Who, when he had found one pearl of great price, went and sold all that he had, and bought it.* The wisdom-stream knew the architecture-of-the-finding-of-the-incomparable-worth; the King names the operative-form at the kingdom-of-heaven register. The pearl-of-great-price = the elect (per the framework''s preferred Father-Son-buyer reading) AS the supreme-worth substance the buyer pays-all-to-obtain.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 45, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 7, 8,
   '*I preferred her before sceptres and thrones, and esteemed riches nothing in comparison of her. Neither compared I unto her any precious stone, because all gold in respect of her is as a little sand, and silver shall be counted as clay before her.* Wisdom of Solomon 7:8-9 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-preferred-above-sceptres-and-thrones architecture: wisdom is preferred-above-rule and esteemed-above-riches-and-precious-stones; the precious-stones are little-sand and silver-is-clay before the supreme-worth of wisdom. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:45-46''s pearl-of-great-price: the wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-supreme-worth-preferred-above-all-else at the wisdom-register; the King names the operative-form at the kingdom-of-heaven register. The buyer (per the framework''s preferred reading at short.md) is the One-who-prefers-the-pearl-above-all-else and pays-the-full-price-to-obtain.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 44, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 7, 14,
   '*For she is a treasure unto men that never faileth: which they that use become the friends of Elohim (God), being commended for the gifts that come from learning.* Wisdom of Solomon 7:14 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the wisdom-is-a-treasure-unto-men-that-never-faileth architecture: wisdom is the never-failing-treasure that makes-the-users-friends-of-Elohim (God). The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:44''s treasure-hid-in-the-field: the wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-never-failing-treasure-of-wisdom; the King names the operative-form at the kingdom-of-heaven register. The treasure-hid-in-the-field is the substance-the-Father-Son-buyer-finds-and-pays-all-to-obtain (per the framework''s preferred reading); the supreme-worth-of-the-treasure operates at the wisdom-stream-and-the-gospel registers together.'),

  -- Thread 9: wheat-from-chaff-and-righteous-from-wicked-at-the-day-of-separation
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 49, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 33,
   '*And the most High shall appear upon the seat of judgment, and misery shall pass away, and the long suffering shall have an end: But judgment only shall remain, truth shall stand, and faith shall wax strong: And the work shall follow, and the reward shall be shewed, and the good deeds shall be of force, and wicked deeds shall bear no rule.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:33-35 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the most-High-appearing-upon-the-seat-of-judgment architecture: the eschatological-judgment lands at the day-of-separation when truth-stands, faith-waxes-strong, good-deeds-are-of-force, and wicked-deeds-bear-no-rule. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:49''s *so shall it be at the end of the world: the angels shall come forth, and sever the wicked from among the just*: the wisdom-stream knew the architecture-of-the-eschatological-separation; the King names the operative-form at the dragnet-recapitulation register. The Son-of-Adam-sends-the-angels at v.41 + Matt 13:49''s angels-sever-the-wicked-from-among-the-just operates in the architecture 4 Ezra 7:33-35 had named.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 49, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 8, 3,
   '*Many be created, but few shall be saved.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 8:3 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the few-shall-be-saved architecture: many-be-created-but-few-shall-be-saved. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:49''s severing-the-wicked-from-among-the-just at the dragnet-recapitulation register: the wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-few-saved-at-the-day-of-separation; the King names the operative-form at the dragnet-of-the-net-cast-into-the-sea-gathering-of-every-kind register. The framework reads the verse in continuity with the Matt 7:13-14 narrow-gate / few-find-it architecture: the wisdom-stream knew the substance the King names; the substance is the post-harvest-sifting per Red Line #11 operative at the eschatological-end-point.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 49, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 100, 5,
   '*And over all the righteous and holy he will appoint guardians from amongst the holy angels to guard them as the apple of an eye, until he makes an end of all wickedness and all sin, and though the righteous sleep a long sleep, they have nought to fear.* 1 Enoch 100:5 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the holy-angels-guarding-the-righteous architecture at the eschatological-judgment register: the angels are-appointed-to-guard-the-righteous as-the-apple-of-an-eye until-the-end-of-all-wickedness-and-all-sin. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:49: the angels-as-guards-and-as-severers operate in the same architecture across the wisdom-stream and the gospel. The Son-of-Adam-sends-the-angels for both the gathering-of-the-righteous AND the severing-of-the-wicked; the wisdom-stream knew the angelic-architecture; the King names the operative-form.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 49, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 8,
   '*They shall judge the nations, and have dominion over the people, and Yahuah (their Lord) shall reign for ever.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:8 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the righteous-shall-judge-the-nations and have-dominion-over-the-people architecture at the eschatological-end-point. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:49''s severing-the-wicked-from-among-the-just: the wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-righteous-judging-the-nations at the eschatological-judgment-and-millennial-reign register; the King''s dragnet-parable lands the architecture at the present-chapter''s recapitulation register. The framework reads the kingdom-of-priests destination-of-the-gathered-remnant per Red Line #7 in continuity: the righteous judge-and-rule the nations-left-after-the-judgment at the millennial-reign; the wisdom-stream and the gospel walk one architecture.'),

  -- Thread 10: seed-war-from-genesis-3-and-the-devil-as-source-of-death
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 39, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 2, 24,
   '*Nevertheless through envy of the devil came death into the world: and they that do hold of his side do find it.* Wisdom of Solomon 2:24 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the through-envy-of-the-devil-came-death-into-the-world architecture: the devil''s envy is the source-of-death entering-the-world; they-that-hold-of-his-side find-death. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:39''s *the enemy that sowed them is the devil; the harvest is the end of the world.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-devil-as-source-of-death-in-the-world; the King names the operative-form at the wheat-and-tares-interpretation register. The framework reads the architecture in continuity: the devil''s envy at Bereshit (Genesis) 3 (the serpent) + the devil''s seduction at the watchers (1 Enoch 6-11) + the devil''s sowing-of-tares at Matt 13:39 = one architecture of the source-of-death-and-corruption across the canon and the wisdom-stream. The they-that-hold-of-his-side find-death substance is the same architecture the children-of-the-wicked-one carry: paternal-source-determines-destination.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 38, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 22, 7,
   '*Then I asked regarding it, and regarding all the hollow places: "Why is one separated from the other?" And he answered me and said unto me: "These three have been made that the spirits of the dead might be separated. And such a division has been made (for) the spirits of the righteous, in which there is the bright spring of water. And such an one has been made for sinners when they die and are buried in the earth and judgement has not been executed on them in their lifetime. Here their spirits shall be set apart in this great pain till the great day of judgement and punishment and torment of those who curse for ever and retribution for their spirits. There He shall bind them for ever. And such a division has been made for the spirits of those who make their suit, who make disclosures concerning their destruction, when they were slain in the days of the sinners. Such has been made for the spirits of men who were not righteous but sinners, who were completely transgressors, and of the transgressors they shall be companions: but their spirits shall not be slain in the day of judgement nor shall they be raised from thence."* 1 Enoch 22:5-7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the spirits-of-the-dead separated-into-four-divisions architecture, with the spirit-of-Hevel (Abel) crying-out-against-Qayin (Cain) as the seed-war''s first-victim-crying-for-vindication (1 Enoch 22:7 names the spirits-who-make-disclosures-concerning-their-destruction-when-slain-in-the-days-of-the-sinners). The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:38''s *the good seed are the children of the kingdom; but the tares are the children of the wicked one.* The wisdom-stream knew the architecture-of-the-seed-war-from-Bereshit-4 with the first-righteous-victim crying-out-against-the-wicked; the King names the operative-form of the wheat-and-tares architecture at the gospel-register. The first-tare (Qayin) and the first-wheat (Hevel) inaugurate the architecture the King''s parable names.'),
  ('canon', 'matthew', 13, 38, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 4, 2,
   '*And in the first (year) of the third jubilee, Qayin (Cain) slew Hevel (Abel) because (God) accepted the sacrifice of Hevel (Abel), and did not accept the offering of Qayin (Cain). And he slew him in the field: and his blood cried from the ground to heaven, complaining because he had slain him.* Jubilees 4:2 names the wisdom-stream''s direct restatement of the Bereshit (Genesis) 4 architecture: Qayin (Cain) slew Hevel (Abel) because Yahuah accepted-Hevel''s-sacrifice and did-not-accept-Qayin''s-offering; the blood-of-Hevel cried-from-the-ground. The framework reads the verse against Matt 13:38: the wisdom-stream witnesses the seed-war''s first-fruit-of-the-tares (Qayin slaying-Hevel) at the same architecture the King''s wheat-and-tares parable names. The framework reads the children-of-the-wicked-one in continuity with the 1 Yochanan (John) 3:12 *not as Qayin (Cain), who was of that wicked one, and slew his brother* identification: Qayin is the wisdom-stream-and-apostolic-letter-identified first-fruit of the children-of-the-wicked-one; the architecture operates from Bereshit-4 forward through the field-of-the-world to the harvest.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s143_verse_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug = i.src_edition
                            AND sv.book_slug    = i.src_slug
                            AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                            AND sv.verse_number  = i.src_v
  JOIN _s143_verse_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug = i.tgt_edition
                            AND tv.book_slug    = i.tgt_slug
                            AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                            AND tv.verse_number  = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

